- [x] I've confirmed that I am using the latest version of Cherry Studio.

### Platform

Windows

### Version

v1.7.9

### Bug Description

When using gpt-5.x model with builtin web search enabled, the response is incorrectly rendered and all parts other than citations are not displayed.

### Steps To Reproduce

Choose gpt-5.x model
Enable builtin web search
Ask something that requires web search

### Expected Behavior

Response correctly rederered

### Relevant Log Output

