### Platform

Windows

### Version

v1.9.4

### Bug Description

When using models via the Vertex AI channel (e.g., gemini-3.1-pro-preview), other tools work perfectly fine. However, as soon as the "Global Memory" feature is enabled in Cherry Studio, sending any message immediately results in an error, preventing the model from generating a response.

### Steps To Reproduce

1. Configure a Vertex AI channel and select a model (e.g., `gemini-3.1-pro-preview`).
2. Enable the "Global Memory" feature.
3. Type any message in the chat (e.g., "Hello") and send it.
4. An `AI_APICallError` occurs immediately.

### Expected Behavior

Generate replies normally

