### Platform

Windows

### Version

v1.9.4

### Bug Description

After the software context conversation is completed, the thinking chain collapsed block keeps incorrectly displaying "thinking" and accumulating time, even though there is already follow-up content. When I switch to another conversation and then switch back, it treats it as a new thinking process and starts timing again.

### Steps To Reproduce

After the software context conversation is completed, the thinking chain collapsed block keeps incorrectly displaying "thinking" and accumulating time, even though there is already follow-up content. When I switch to another conversation and then switch back, it treats it as a new thinking process and starts timing again.

### Expected Behavior

Hope this bug that incorrectly keeps showing "thinking" can be fixed.

